<div class="wrap">
  <section class="ch" id="pack"><p class="ch__num">05 · Start</p><h2>Pack the cup</h2><p class="ch__lead">Two light layers of your usual tobacco. First choose the mesh: it changes the smoke, the pack and the heat.</p><div class="grams"><b>10–15 g</b><span>of your usual tobacco. <b>Mix it first:</b> the juice settles at the bottom of the tin.</span></div><h3>Touching or not: two meshes</h3><p class="h3lead">It is the same craft as packing a bowl for coal. The difference is whether the tobacco touches the hot cup.</p><div class="slider tslider slider--grid" style="--n:2"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Flat screen: in contact</b><p>The tobacco sits against the cup, like a bowl packed in contact under the coals: a deeper roast, a fuller, denser smoke, and it needs less heat. Fine, dry cuts open up best here, Tangiers for example. A little more work to clean.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.flat_screen != blank -%}{{- section.settings.flat_screen | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.flat_screen.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.flat_screen.width, height: section.settings.flat_screen.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-flat-screen.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Basket mesh: off the walls</b><p>The basket holds the tobacco away from the cup: an airy, fluffy pack, a lighter smoke, and it needs more heat. Moist and strong blends feel much smoother. Lifts out in one piece to clean.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.basket_empty != blank -%}{{- section.settings.basket_empty | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.basket_empty.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.basket_empty.width, height: section.settings.basket_empty.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-basket-empty.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3>Pick your mesh, then pack</h3><div class="mpick"><button type="button" class="mpick__c on" data-mesh="basket" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="pack-basket">{%- if section.settings.img_basket != blank -%}{{- section.settings.img_basket | image_url: width: 300 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_basket.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.img_basket.width, height: section.settings.img_basket.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-basket.webp' | file_url }}" alt="">{%- endif -%}<b>Basket mesh</b><dl><div><dt>Smoke</dt><dd>Lighter and airy</dd></div><div><dt>Pack</dt><dd>Loose and fluffy, pressed just a little</dd></div><div><dt>Heat</dt><dd>Needs more: set the dial higher</dd></div><div><dt>Cleaning</dt><dd>Easy: lifts out in one piece</dd></div></dl><span class="mpick__open">How to pack it</span></button><div class="mpane on" id="pack-basket"><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:5"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Basket in the cup</b><p>Set the basket mesh in the cup.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.basket_empty != blank -%}{{- section.settings.basket_empty | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.basket_empty.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.basket_empty.width, height: section.settings.basket_empty.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-basket-empty.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>First layer</b><p>Lay in about half of the 10–15 g, loosely.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.pack_layer1 != blank -%}{{- section.settings.pack_layer1 | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.pack_layer1.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.pack_layer1.width, height: section.settings.pack_layer1.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-pack-layer1.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Press just a little</b><p>Press it down gently with a pick. Keep it airy.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.pack_press != blank -%}{{- section.settings.pack_press | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.pack_press.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.pack_press.width, height: section.settings.pack_press.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-pack-press.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Second layer</b><p>The rest on top, the same blend or another flavour, pressed just a little again.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.pack_layer2 != blank -%}{{- section.settings.pack_layer2 | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.pack_layer2.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.pack_layer2.width, height: section.settings.pack_layer2.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-pack-layer2.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">5</span><b>To the edge</b><p>Stop at the edge of the mesh. Then set the dial a little higher.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.cup_filled != blank -%}{{- section.settings.cup_filled | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.cup_filled.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.cup_filled.width, height: section.settings.cup_filled.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-filled.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></div><button type="button" class="mpick__c" data-mesh="flat" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pack-flat">{%- if section.settings.img_screens != blank -%}{{- section.settings.img_screens | image_url: width: 300 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_screens.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.img_screens.width, height: section.settings.img_screens.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-screens-2.webp' | file_url }}" alt="">{%- endif -%}<b>Flat screen</b><dl><div><dt>Smoke</dt><dd>Fuller and denser</dd></div><div><dt>Pack</dt><dd>Even layers, pressed lightly</dd></div><div><dt>Heat</dt><dd>Needs less: more contact with the cup</dd></div><div><dt>Cleaning</dt><dd>More work: brush the screen and the cup</dd></div></dl><span class="mpick__open">How to pack it</span></button><div class="mpane" id="pack-flat"><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:4"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Screen on the bottom</b><p>Lay the flat screen on the bottom of the cup.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.flat_screen != blank -%}{{- section.settings.flat_screen | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.flat_screen.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.flat_screen.width, height: section.settings.flat_screen.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-flat-screen.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>First layer</b><p>Lay in about half of the 10–15 g, evenly, and press lightly.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.flat_layer1 != blank -%}{{- section.settings.flat_layer1 | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.flat_layer1.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.flat_layer1.width, height: section.settings.flat_layer1.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-flat-layer1.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Second layer</b><p>The rest on top, pressed lightly.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.flat_layer2 != blank -%}{{- section.settings.flat_layer2 | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.flat_layer2.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.flat_layer2.width, height: section.settings.flat_layer2.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-flat-layer2.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>To the brim</b><p>Stop at the small tab of the cup. Then set the dial a little lower.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.flat_packed != blank -%}{{- section.settings.flat_packed | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.flat_packed.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.flat_packed.width, height: section.settings.flat_packed.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-flat-packed.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></div></div><h3>Mix in layers</h3><div class="pk-heatmap">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 360 310" role="img" aria-label="The ENSŌ Diamond cup in section: heat comes from the sides and from below, strongest at the bottom">
        <defs><linearGradient id="hg" x1="0" y1="1" x2="0" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#e2614c"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#e7a35a"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#f3dfb8"/></linearGradient></defs>

        <path d="M24 52Q24 66 40 68Q78 74 84 96L84 214Q84 248 118 248L160 248L160 272L200 272L200 248L242 248Q276 248 276 214L276 96Q282 74 320 68Q336 66 336 52Z" fill="#1d1b19"/>
        <path d="M44 56Q86 60 98 86L98 210Q98 234 122 234L238 234Q262 234 262 210L262 86Q274 60 316 56Z" fill="url(#hg)" opacity=".94"/>
        <rect x="172" y="234" width="16" height="30" fill="#1d1b19"/>
        <line x1="100" y1="146" x2="260" y2="146" stroke="#1d1b19" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/>
        <text x="180" y="116" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter" font-weight="800" font-size="17" fill="#3a2a10">Accent</text>
        <text x="180" y="196" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter" font-weight="800" font-size="17" fill="#fff">Main flavour</text>
        <g stroke="#e2614c" stroke-width="3.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"><path class="hu" d="M120 306v-18m0 0-6 7m6-7 6 7"/><path class="hu" d="M240 306v-18m0 0-6 7m6-7 6 7"/><path class="hl" d="M30 130h22m0 0-7-6m7 6-7 6"/><path class="hl" d="M30 196h22m0 0-7-6m7 6-7 6"/><path class="hr" d="M330 130h-22m0 0 7-6m-7 6 7 6"/><path class="hr" d="M330 196h-22m0 0 7-6m-7 6 7 6"/></g>
      </svg>
      <div><p class="pk-lead" style="margin:0">Diamond heats the cup from the sides and from below at the same time; the tobacco at the bottom gets it most. So the bottom layer is your main flavour and opens first, and the top layer is the accent that comes through as the cup warms. Two flavours are plenty.</p></div>
    </div><h3>By tobacco</h3><div class="pk-cards">
      <article>{%- if section.settings.cup_filled != blank -%}{{- section.settings.cup_filled | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'pk-cardimg', alt: section.settings.cup_filled.alt | default: 'A cup packed with blonde leaf tobacco', width: section.settings.cup_filled.width, height: section.settings.cup_filled.height -}}{%- else -%}<img class="pk-cardimg" src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-filled.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="A cup packed with blonde leaf tobacco">{%- endif -%}<h3>Virginia, blonde leaf</h3><p class="pk-eg">Starline, Fumari, Adalya</p><p>Pre-heat 7 minutes at about 255 °C, then turn it down as the session goes.</p>
        <p class="pk-tip">Very minty or perfumed blends: less heat, around 235 °C, and let the cup open up over time.</p></article>
      <article>{%- if section.settings.dark_leaf_packed != blank -%}{{- section.settings.dark_leaf_packed | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'pk-cardimg', alt: section.settings.dark_leaf_packed.alt | default: 'A cup packed with dark leaf tobacco', width: section.settings.dark_leaf_packed.width, height: section.settings.dark_leaf_packed.height -}}{%- else -%}<img class="pk-cardimg" src="{{ 'dm-s-dark-leaf-packed.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="A cup packed with dark leaf tobacco">{%- endif -%}<h3>Burley, dark leaf</h3><p class="pk-eg">Darkside, MustHave, BlackBurn</p><p>Pack it airy in the basket mesh. Pre-heat 7 minutes, like every blend; the strongest like it at up to 290 °C.</p>
        <p class="pk-tip">Try Oracle, the fourth profile.</p></article>

    </div><h3>Into the chamber</h3><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:3"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Cap off</b><p>Lift the cap off by its rubber pads. The chamber is empty.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.chamber_empty != blank -%}{{- section.settings.chamber_empty | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.chamber_empty.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.chamber_empty.width, height: section.settings.chamber_empty.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-chamber-empty.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Cup in</b><p>Set the packed cup straight into the chamber before you switch on. Do not press it down.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.cup_in_by_hand != blank -%}{{- section.settings.cup_in_by_hand | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.cup_in_by_hand.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.cup_in_by_hand.width, height: section.settings.cup_in_by_hand.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-in-by-hand.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Cap on</b><p>Put the cap back on, holding it by the rubber pads.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.cap_on_press != blank -%}{{- section.settings.cap_on_press | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.cap_on_press.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.cap_on_press.width, height: section.settings.cap_on_press.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-cap-on-press-pad.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3 id="cup-tool">Out, swap, clean: the cup tool</h3><p class="h3lead">The fork only takes the cup out: to clean, to change the cup mid-session, when the taste fades or the tobacco is spent. Its other end turns the plate on the cap, see <a href="#the-cap">The cap and the draw</a>.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:3"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Fork under the brim</b><p>Slide the fork under the brim of the cup.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.cup_tool_seated != blank -%}{{- section.settings.cup_tool_seated | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.cup_tool_seated.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.cup_tool_seated.width, height: section.settings.cup_tool_seated.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-tool-seated.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Lift it straight out</b><p>Lift straight up. The cup is hot: set it down on a heat-safe surface.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.cup_tool_lower != blank -%}{{- section.settings.cup_tool_lower | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.cup_tool_lower.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.cup_tool_lower.width, height: section.settings.cup_tool_lower.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-tool-lower.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Next cup in</b><p>Swapping? Set the next packed cup in and close the cap.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.cup_seated_tool_off != blank -%}{{- section.settings.cup_seated_tool_off | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.cup_seated_tool_off.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.cup_seated_tool_off.width, height: section.settings.cup_seated_tool_off.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-cup-seated-tool-off.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><p class="more"><a href="packing.html">The packing guide: tobaccos, mixes and heat ›</a></p></section>
</div>

